'''Revive''' was an {{Uncommon}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costed {{Money|550,000}} or {{Robux|975}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Revive could revive the player by using {{Ability|C}} after being killed. This was the only fruit with this ability, but it was very unused because of the fact that it had only two attack moves, and they were often not useful.

