==Overview==
{{Tabber
|Pros|
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Did not cost a lot to obtain.
* Did not require high mastery.

|'''[Z] Possession'''
* Good stun.
* Good [[AoE]].
* Good mobility.

|'''[X] Soul Ruler'''
* Decent damage.
* Great stun.

|'''[C] Resurrection'''
* Gave the user a second life if the move is active.
* Could easily defy one-shot combos (though at the cost of the first life).

|'''[F] Wandering Soul'''
* While using this move the user’s ghost body is immortal.
}}

|Cons|
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* It had no ranged moves and only two attack moves.
* Not ideal for grinding due to the lack of [[Elemental]] immunity and moves that deal damage.
* Ground-based and not good against combos although the user could run when their first life was over.

|'''[Z] Possession'''
* Slight delay while using the move.

|'''[X] Soul Ruler'''
* Small [[AoE]].

|'''[C] Resurrection'''
* Not really useful to counter long combos. (Such as [[Dough/Combos|Dough combos]])

|'''[F] Wandering Soul'''
* Quite slow.
* Left the user unprotected and had a time limit.
* Bad for traveling from island to island because of the limited distance and the user could not use it above water as they would take damage unless the user has the [[Shark]] race V2 or V3. The user could also hold space while using the [[flight]] move to make their main body keep [[Air Jump|jumping]], but it fails sometimes. (If they have high ping.)
}}
}}

==Notes==
* {{Ability|Z}} and {{Ability|F}} had a small gray cube in the avatar of the user. When using the Z move in first person, the cube spins. The F move just stays inside of the user's avatar. This cube prevents the user from walking through walls.
* If the player used {{Ability|F}} while being in a safe zone, they could leave the safe zone during the flight and their body would stay in the safe zone (meaning it could not be attacked). However, if the time ends it would be teleported back to them.
* The total travel time/distance of Revive's {{Ability|F}} was roughly the length of [[Pirate Village]], from the very back where the [[Brute]]s are located all the way to the docks.

==Trivia==
* Revive was the only fruit that could revive players.
* Revive was one of the only three fruits that can freeze opponents (the others being [[Ice]] and [[Spirit]]).
* When the user revived as a skeleton from Resurrection, the skeleton was actually a Roblox Rthro package called Skelly. It also removed the hair from the package.
** The skeleton was normal without clothes, however, if they used jackets from Roblox, the jacket would have stayed, this was a Roblox bug that happens in most games. This only works in specific Roblox accessories.
* When Revive F move was used, the user's physical body could be harmed and if they used it when they were right above [[water]], they would take damage. However, there was a bug where they were able to spam jump (during the flight) and their body would keep jumping on the sea giving them free time to use their [[flight]].

